  "source": "C:\\Users\\ducnq\\Downloads\\Video/episodes/beer-bottle-brown-glass/subtitles-raw.json remapped through C:\\Users\\ducnq\\Downloads\\Video/public/audio/beer-bottle-brown-glass.timemap.json",
  "audio": "public/audio/beer-bottle-brown-glass.wav",
  "duration": 26.96,
  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Beer almost always comes in brown glass,",
      "start": 0.071,
      "end": 2.018
    },
    {
      "text": "because light physically breaks beer.",
      "start": 2.21,
      "end": 3.657
    },
    {
      "text": "Hops leave compounds in the liquid",
      "start": 3.949,
      "end": 5.451
    },
    {
      "text": "that are stable in the dark.",
      "start": 5.754,
      "end": 6.754
    },
    {
      "text": "Hit them with blue and ultraviolet light,",
      "start": 7.038,
      "end": 8.825
    },
    {
      "text": "and riboflavin,",
      "start": 9.043,
      "end": 9.918
    },
    {
      "text": "a vitamin already in the beer,",
      "start": 10.205,
      "end": 11.436
    },
    {
      "text": "acts as a middleman.",
      "start": 11.717,
      "end": 12.468
    },
    {
      "text": "It absorbs the light and hands the energy along",
      "start": 12.748,
      "end": 14.803
    },
    {
      "text": "until those hop compounds",
      "start": 14.856,
      "end": 15.982
    },
    {
      "text": "shatter into something chemically close to",
      "start": 16.357,
      "end": 17.947
    },
    {
      "text": "skunk spray.",
      "start": 18.036,
      "end": 18.59
    },
    {
      "text": "That is not a figure of speech.",
      "start": 18.873,
      "end": 20.284
    },
    {
      "text": "Brown glass blocks nearly all of those wavelengths.",
      "start": 20.593,
      "end": 22.915
    },
    {
      "text": "Green blocks a fraction,",
      "start": 23.236,
      "end": 24.291
    },
    {
      "text": "which is why some imports taste faintly like",
      "start": 24.511,
      "end": 26.298
    },
    {
      "text": "a warning.",
      "start": 26.351,
      "end": 26.887
    }
  ],
